# check_links.ignore — intentional exceptions for scripts/check_links.sh.
# Native to this repo (the script itself is exported from the source repo;
# this file is not). Format: one entry per line, either
#   <source-glob>                  skip ALL relative links in matching files
#   <source-glob><TAB><target-re>  skip links whose target matches, in those files
# Every entry carries a comment saying why the exception is legitimate.

# experiments/ holds curated example outputs copied from the source repo's
# experiments, verbatim. Their links are written against the source repo's
# tree (modules that are not exported here, memory files), so they resolve
# there, not here. The example is evidence, not a page to maintain.
experiments/**
